title: Włodzimierz Czarzasty
subtitle: Alliance discipline, parliamentary machinery and emergency funds.
is-pinned-card: true
tags: poland_advisor
view-if: czarzasty_advisor = 1
card-image: img/poland/cards/advisor-czarzasty.webp
new-page: true

= Włodzimierz Czarzasty

Czarzasty sits at the centre of the SLD apparatus and the new parliamentary
club. He can compel a compromise, find money or wipe a poisoned agenda clean.
Every favour strengthens the machinery that the younger Left wants to change.

- @czarzasty_discipline
- @czarzasty_fundraising
- @czarzasty_clear
- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@czarzasty_discipline
title: Enforce a caucus truce
subtitle: Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months. Lowers dissent, but reinforces the apparatus.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor intervention is still on cooldown.
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.party_unity += 3;
Q.barons_strength += 1;
for (const faction of Q.factions) {
    Q[faction + "_dissent"] -= 2;
}
Q.razem_cooperation -= 1;
Q.news_headline = "Czarzasty imposes an uneasy caucus truce";
!}

Phone calls, committee assignments and a closed meeting end the latest round
of public freelancing. The peace is real. So is the reminder of who holds the
keys.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@czarzasty_fundraising
title: Call the old donor and municipal network
subtitle: +2 resources. Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months; fundraising lock: 16 months.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and emergency_fundraising_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor intervention is active, or the donor network is still recovering from the last emergency appeal.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; emergency_fundraising_timer = 16; resources += 2; public_trust -= 1; barons_strength += 2; barons_dissent -= 2; progressives_dissent += 2; news_headline = "The old network pays the next round of bills"

Mayors, former officeholders and business contacts cover the immediate
shortfall. Nobody asks for a receipt in front of the younger organisers.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@czarzasty_clear
title: Clear the leadership agenda
subtitle: Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months. Discard every held card and redraw from scratch.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor intervention is still on cooldown.
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
this.state.currentHands["poland_hub"] = [];
Q.news_headline = "The leadership tears up a poisoned agenda";
!}

Every memo goes back to its author. This avoids an immediate fight, but spends
the chairman's authority without resolving the underlying questions.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@miller
title: Leszek Miller
subtitle: Old-SLD discipline, county organisation and veteran media authority.
is-pinned-card: true
tags: poland_advisor
view-if: miller_advisor = 1
card-image: img/poland/party-logos/sld.svg
new-page: true

= Leszek Miller

Miller controls the restored SLD machinery from a locked bureau seat. He can
impose discipline, reactivate county offices or put a veteran voice at the
centre of the campaign, always at a cost to the younger Left.

- @miller_discipline
- @miller_counties
- @miller_broadcast
- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@miller_discipline
title: Impose old-SLD executive discipline
subtitle: Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months. Raises unity while sharpening progressive dissent.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor intervention is still on cooldown.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; party_unity += 3; barons_dissent -= 5; pps_dissent -= 2; progressives_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Miller imposes discipline through the restored SLD executive"

The restored executive issues instructions and expects them obeyed. County
chairmen who spent two years ignoring the leadership fall into line; the
activists who joined after 2019 find out which party they actually joined.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@miller_counties
title: Reactivate the old county offices
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months. Rebuilds local organisation through the old apparatus.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor acted recently, or the county operation cannot be funded.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources -= 1; local_network += 4; barons_strength += 2; public_trust -= 1; progressives_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Miller reactivates the old SLD county network"

The old addresses still work. Offices reopen above shops in towns the national
campaign has not visited in a decade, staffed by people who remember exactly
how this was done and have no interest in being retrained.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@miller_broadcast
title: Put the veteran leader back on every broadcast
subtitle: Shared advisor cooldown: 6 months. Gains older and working-class attention at a credibility cost.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Another advisor intervention is still on cooldown.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; media_capacity += 3; pensioner_support += 3; workers_support += 1; young_support -= 2; public_trust -= 1; progressives_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Miller returns to the centre of the Left's media campaign"

Miller is comfortable on television in a way none of the younger leaders are,
and the studios know it. He wins the argument on terms that remind every voter
under thirty-five which decade the Left's most fluent voice comes from.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@biedron
