= Wanda Nowicka

Nowicka brings feminist movement experience and the procedural memory of a
former deputy speaker. She can convert a demand into a bill without pretending
that parliamentary ownership is the same thing as movement consent.

- @nowicka_bill
- @nowicka_movement
- @nowicka_committee
- @poland_hub: Return

